From 4e507365756309b1bd3cf1bfd652d34afca44552 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ravonus <chadkoslovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 21:45:21 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add art-montage layers, datamosh/mosaic/displace
 transitions, loop seam and silent delivery

Generic-profile extensions: stage shots composed from blended layers, bloom/chroma/pulse post effects, block-motion datamosh, stepped mosaic and chromatic displacement transitions, a seamless loop seam, and silent H.264 delivery with video-only size targeting. Reference (crucible-v3) behaviour is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
